    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d763">

                <pb facs="0827" n="723" xml:id="pg723"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00 Revolutions/339: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Puerto Cortés</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wasson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Puerto Cortés</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-11-14T08:00:00-06:00">November 14,
                            1932—8 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Government forces captured San Pedro Sula early this morning. Coleman reported
                    killed in plaza. Am informed that no foreigners were killed or wounded.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wasson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
